%rec: Class
%mandatory: Week
%type: Topics line
%type: Exercises line
%type: Reading line
%type: Assigned line
%type: Due line
%type: Media line
%type: Slides line
%doc: One record per week of Fa26 I 320U Information and Interaction Design.
+ Class meets Monday and Wednesday. Entries within a field are separated by
+ ';'. A leading '(mon)' or '(mon, wed)' sets the day(s); an entry without a
+ day tag inherits the previous entry's days. Due days are the real Canvas
+ due days, so (fri), (sat), (sun) occur as well.
+   Topics:    lecture topics, from syllabus/syllabus.qmd
+   Exercises: in-class exercises (ungraded Canvas assignments)
+   Reading:   @citekeys from syllabus/master.bib, with chapters in parentheses
+   Assigned:  homework handed out, on the first class day of the week before
+              it is due
+   Due:       homework due; names match the Canvas assignment names
+   Media:     Canvas file names or URLs with a title in parentheses
+   Slides:    deck URLs on mickmcquaid.com with a title in parentheses

